.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-done 1  "done " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-done \- Complete a task
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit done\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Complete a task
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIR\fR>
A row number from the last listing, or an id prefix of 6+ characters
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit done 1
  orbit done 3f2b9c
  orbit done 1 \-\-dry\-run
